# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the gate and readout noise for the 49-qubit checked-Ising circuit {#learn-the-gate-and-readout-noise-for-the-49-qubit-checked-ising-circuit}"
msgstr "Pelajari hingar gate dan pembacaan untuk litar Ising 49-qubit yang diperiksa {#learn-the-gate-and-readout-noise-for-the-49-qubit-checked-ising-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To mitigate the noise, we must model how the noise is affecting our entangling gates. Here we learn a Pauli-Lindblad noise model for each of the circuit's three unique entangling layers using [qiskit-noise-learning](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-noise-learning). Later, we will prune this noise model of error generators that are detectable by the symmetry checks and mitigate only the remaining noise channel with PEC. The map below shows the three learned layers on the QPU; each qubit is a wheel of its weight-1 X/Y/Z rates, and each coupler a 3×3 grid of the weight-2 Pauli rates on that pair. The $\\gamma$ value of $10$ implies a sampling overhead of $\\gamma^2=10^2=100$.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengurangkan hingar, kita perlu memodelkan bagaimana hingar menjejaskan gate pengbelitan kita. Di sini kita mempelajari model hingar Pauli-Lindblad untuk setiap satu daripada tiga lapisan pengbelitan unik litar tersebut menggunakan [qiskit-noise-learning](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-noise-learning). Kemudian, kita akan membuang daripada model hingar ini penjana ralat yang dapat dikesan oleh pemeriksaan simetri dan hanya mengurangkan saluran hingar yang tinggal dengan PEC. Peta di bawah menunjukkan tiga lapisan yang dipelajari pada QPU; setiap qubit ialah roda kadar berat-1 X/Y/Z-nya, dan setiap penggandeng ialah grid 3×3 kadar Pauli berat-2 pada pasangan tersebut. Nilai $\\gamma$ sebanyak $10$ menunjukkan overhed pensampelan sebanyak $\\gamma^2=10^2=100$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The readout (TREX) corrections come directly from the SPAM paths of the noise-learning fit. The stem plot below the QPU noise map shows the per-observable TREX rescale factors.\n"
msgstr "Pembetulan pembacaan (TREX) datang secara langsung daripada laluan SPAM padanan pembelajaran hingar. Plot batang di bawah peta hingar QPU menunjukkan faktor penskalaan semula TREX bagi setiap boleh cerap.\n"

